empty index,\nsorry-free)** — the core of Mathlib's `proof_wanted\nIsSemisimpleRing.matrix` in the division-ring case. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple.columnsEquiv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple.columnsEquiv","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MatrixSemisimple.lean#L83-L96","doc":"**Column decomposition of the regular module (sorry-free):** the\nmatrix ring, as a left module over itself, is the finite product of\nits columns. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple.instIsSimpleModule_vec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple.instIsSimpleModule_vec","kind":"instance","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MatrixSemisimple.lean#L63-L81","doc":"**The column module is simple (sorry-free):** `n → K` is a simple\n`Matrix n n K`-module for nonempty `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple.exists_smul_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.MatrixSemisimple.exists_smul_eq","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/MatrixSemisimple.lean#L45-L61","doc":"**Transitivity of the matrix action (sorry-free):** over a division\nring, any nonzero vector reaches any vector. ","signatureChunk":0}]}